Cell["\<\
Let \[Mu]21 = 0, and \[Mu]32 = 0. Since \[Mu]21 = 0, \[Mu]31 has to be 0 as \
well (by construction). 
Now I just have to ensure \[Mu]11 is positive and \[Mu]22 is positive.\
\>", "Text",
